    "title": "I really believe that he is going to enter the top 10 … - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By HoopsHype ,\n21 hours ago\nOh No He Didn't: Brian Windhorst on Cooper Flagg: ”In all honesty, I feel like there's not enough hype around Cooper Flagg. I don't think people realized how breathtaking Cooper Flagg's performance was last season. He absolutely reminded me on an almost nightly basis of LeBron as a rookie. I really believe that he is going to enter the top 10 of best players in the league sooner rather than later. And that his trajectory is really right there alongside Victor Wembanyama's in terms of the future of the NBA\"\nx.com\nThis article originally appeared on Hoops Hype: I really believe that he is going to enter the top 10 …",
